# .piignore
#
# Prevent Pi from loading specific resources when working in this directory.
# Useful for avoiding conflicts between local development and globally installed packages.
#
# Examples:
#
# Ignore all skills:
# skills/
#
# Ignore specific skill:
# skills/github/
#
# Ignore all extensions:
# extensions/
#
# Ignore specific extension:
# extensions/task-list/
#
# Ignore all themes:
# themes/
#
# Patterns support:
# skills/*/           # All skill directories
# extensions/*.ts     # All TypeScript extension files
# **/*.test.ts        # All test files recursively
